##Goal
The goal was to be able to turn Google Docs into AI-generated summaries while automatically creating a new Google Doc with this new summarised version.
On top of that, the goal was also to make it easier to pass a detialed document onto another team or person. Instead of reading several apges with unorganised information, rather read half the amount of pages with all the key context.

---
##Workflow structure
Frontend
      ↓
Webhook
      ↓
n8n
      ↓
Google Docs
      ↓
AI
      ↓
Create Summary
      ↓
Create New Google Doc
      ↓
Return URL

---
##The node structure in n8n
1. Recieving Google Docs ID node
2. Combine text node - makes it more digestable for the AI agent
3. AI agent + OpenAI chat model
4. Create new Google Docs node
5. Update Google Docs node
6. Returned webhook

---
#Inputs
- Google Docs URL or ID
- The length in which you want the summarisation 
- The style of summarisation you want
- Possible additional requests

---
##Outputs
- A new Google Docs with the summarised information
